# Paw Legends game build (Vite). Copy to .env.local; never commit .env*.local.
# PostHog: the one Token Tails project (US Cloud), the same names as client/ and pawlegends-web.
# Public, ingest-only token. Events leave the device only after consent (src/analytics/posthog.ts).
# The app build (pawlegends-app/scripts/build-web.mjs) forces the token empty: no analytics in the app.
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_PROJECT_TOKEN=
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
